#     channel''s sector of the primary at the field stop, measured from the channels against one another and applied here, which moves
#     each channel''s sky along its dispersion without moving the windows.  drift_x and drift_y are the measured motion of each channel''s
#     windows from their position at frame 15, and yaw_grating and pitch_grating the per-channel grating offsets that reproduce it.'}
